OL,3,GNEWSAMum feels 'heard' as PM responds
OL,4,Ato drowning campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a boy who drowned off
OL,7,FBournemouth Beach has said she feels
OL,8,F"heard" after the prime minister
OL,9,Fresponded to a water safety campaign.
OL,11,FVanessa Abbess, from Southampton,
OL,12,Fjoined other bereaved families in
OL,13,Fdelivering a letter to Downing Street
OL,14,Fon Tuesday calling for greater action
OL,15,Fto prevent similar deaths and the
OL,16,Fappointment of a water safety minister.
OL,18,FVanessa's 17-year-old son Joe died on
OL,19,F31 May 2023 after being caught in a rip
OL,20,Fcurrent. Twelve-year-old Sunnah Khan,
OL,21,Ffrom High Wycombe, also died in the
OL,22,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
