OL,3,GNEWSAMum feels 'heard' as PM responds
OL,4,Ato drowning campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham thanked the families and
OL,7,Fthe national Save Lives for Sam
OL,8,Fcampaign, and said the government would
OL,9,Fcontinue working on a new drowning
OL,10,Fprevention strategy.
